    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="pa_d6">

                <pb facs="pa_d6-1" n="1" xml:id="pa_d6-1"/>

                <head>PA–6. Telegram from the Chargé in Bolivia (Carter) to the Department of
                        State<anchor n="1" xml:id="pa_d6-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Asunción</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1958-09-22T22:00:00-04:00">September 22,
                            1958, 10 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>64. DEPTEL 59.<anchor n="2" xml:id="pa_d6-f2"/> Under Secretary Foreign
                        Office<anchor n="3" xml:id="pa_d6-f3"/> today again referred GOP desire massive aid and cited news reports
                    additional aid Bolivia and Bolivian Congress recommendation trade and diplomatic
                    relations Russia. I took occasion emphasize all points reference telegram
                    leaving no doubt our attitude. Emphasized our aid based GOP need, that aid Bolivia also aids Paraguay. Later in day
                    confidant President Stroessner
                    approached me same subject and I replied similar vein adding would be better if
                    this new approach abandoned before going any further. He said he would report
                    this back to President. My impression is conversations had sobering effect both
                    individuals.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold"
                            >Carter</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
